'''Hallow's Blade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it from the [[Traveller (NPC)|Mysterious Traveller]] for 100 [[Candies (2016)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2016}}during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is white in the shape of a cutlass with spiky purple pumpkin vines going along the spine. The guard is made out of a purple pumpkin with four purple horns and a demonic face imprinted on it in black. Dark turquoise pumpkin vines protrude out from behind the pumpkin. The handle is purple in color with the bottom of it being curled.

==Trivia== 

*There are [[Red Hallow|red]], [[Bronze Hallow|bronze]], [[Silver Hallow|silver]], and [[Golden Hallow|gold]] variants of this knife, which were released as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies.
* Its has an orange variant from the year prior under the name [[Hallow's Edge|Hallow’s Edge]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/181356054/All-Hallows-Sword All Hallow's Sword] with the orange parts recoloured purple.
*When salvaged, it provides 10 godly [[shards]].

